    panel = f'''<details id="voxtral-realtime"><summary>Voxtral 4-bit research: 150 real calls, one empty speech case, no promotion.</summary><p>The exact pinned MLX conversion runs full-file and stateful 320 ms packet paths at configured 480 ms delay on twenty known English clips, fifty existing FLEURS clips and five synthetic nonspeech controls. All 150 source/sample/PCM checks and independently recomputed WER/CER metrics pass, with zero API errors or early stream completion. {checked["identical_text_pairs"]}/75 text pairs are identical. <strong>One quiet Japanese source returns empty in both modes</strong>; five previously checked shipping engines return nonempty text on that same original file. This identifies a candidate limitation, not its cause.</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Known slice</th><th>Clips</th><th>Primary metric</th><th>Full-file → stream</th><th>First partial input position p50</th><th>Final flush p50</th></tr></thead><tbody>{''.join(rows)}</tbody></table></div><p>Both raw model paths stay empty on all five synthetic nonspeech controls; OSpr’s exact-zero bypass is intentionally absent. The peak observed MLX allocation is 6,024,226,688 bytes, not total application RAM. Every observed stream event retains its left pad and all submitted raw samples, so bounded residency remains integration work. The standalone mel check matches every feature shape but exceeds fixed numerical tolerance 2e−5 in 18/20 cases (maximum 0.0002053); that failure is retained and alone does not establish ASR harm.</p><p class="small muted">M5 Max, 128 GiB, macOS 26.6.2. These are reused inputs, unpaced packets and automatic language detection. Input position includes original leading silence and is not microphone or word-relative latency. Full-file runs precede stream runs; compute timing is diagnostic. The older Nemotron replay on the same twenty English clip IDs reports 4.30% WER, first input position 1.28 s and 14.7 ms flush, with a different driver and explicit English hint: no balanced head-to-head or universal ranking is established. No shipping model, picker, dependency lock, defaults or ZIP changes. Quiet-speech recovery, bounded queues/cancellation, long sessions and native capture/insertion remain gates. <a href="../benchmarks/results/voxtral-study.json">All group metrics</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/voxtral-study.traces.json.gz">Every reference, hypothesis and partial</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/voxtral-study-checks.json">Independent sample/metric checks</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/voxtral-frontend.json">Frontend numerical failures</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/voxtral-source-validation.json">Source and hardware boundary</a> · <a href="architecture/voxtral-realtime-evaluation.md">Protocol and open integration work</a> · <a href="https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Voxtral-Mini-4B-Realtime-2602">Upstream card</a>.</p></details>'''
