    panel = f'''<details id="stream-normalization"><summary>Native packet repair: continuous resampling preserves whole-file PCM.</summary><p>The cadence study exposed a separate normalization defect. Independently resampling each native microphone packet reset filter boundaries and rounded each output length upward. New source retains a bounded phase-aligned FIR halo, waits for necessary future samples and flushes the final zero-padded tail before closing the recognizer. Sixteen-kilohertz input remains a direct path. Rate changes reject preview, retaining final-file fallback. Header limits precede decoding; cancel/replacement/final success release state.</p><p><strong>All twelve corrected real-session PCM hashes and final texts match whole-normalized controls.</strong> The fixed replay uses three known public English clips, 44.1/48 kHz, two partitions and three routes: 36 actual cached Nemotron sessions. All routes have 8 errors / 236 repeated reference words, 3.39% WER. The repair preserves audio continuity without an observed accuracy gain.</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Route</th><th>Sessions</th><th>Whole PCM matches</th><th>Whole count matches</th><th>WER</th></tr></thead><tbody>{rows}</tbody></table></div><p>Fifteen fixed synthetic cases and two 120-second streams also match exact whole-file bytes. Retained raw state peaks at <strong>507 samples at 44.1 kHz / 73 at 48 kHz</strong> between packets; transient memory includes the bounded current packet. This describes the resampler, not upstream recognizer caches or total RAM. The independent checker reconstructs whole/legacy PCM, sample positions and edit distances without importing the candidate class. Local checks pass <strong>310 Swift / 230 Python tests</strong>, lint, release app build and signature verification.</p><p class="small muted">Unpaced replay on reused single-speaker English clips; no microphone/IPC/UI latency, energy, device-interruption or general accuracy claim. Actual native preview failure/rate-change/stop-cancellation acceptance remains open. Preview stays opt-in. The checked 9a51603 standalone ZIP predates both this and the cadence source changes. <a href="../benchmarks/results/stream-normalization-real.json">Frozen replay and stress receipts</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/stream-normalization-real.traces.json.gz">Every real transcript and partial</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/stream-normalization-checks.json">Independent checks</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/stream-normalization-source-validation.json">Bound source validation</a> · <a href="architecture/stream-normalization.md">Implementation and remaining acceptance</a>.</p></details>'''
