    panel = f'''<details id="streaming-package"><summary>Latest checked local preview: streaming continuity and cadence, source {esc(package["build"]["git_commit"][:7])}.</summary><p>The separate <strong>streaming-v0</strong> preview includes continuous native-rate normalization, steady preview deadlines and visible preview failure handling, plus full-audio defaults and bounded ASR timings. ZIP: <strong>{package["archive_bytes"]:,} bytes</strong>, SHA-256 <code>{esc(package["archive_sha256"])}</code>. Previous previews remain intact; weights download separately. This is an Apple Development signed macOS 26.6.2 arm64 preview, without Developer ID/notarization.</p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Exact-build gate</th><th>Verified</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Source Mac CI</td><td>310 Swift / 230 Python tests, native replay typecheck, app/report build, clean-runner runtime</td></tr><tr><td>Relocation and offline models</td><td>Six engines + six exact-PCM neural routes, notes/speakers/mix/review/MCP</td></tr><tr><td>Native client/worker stop boundary</td><td>Ten real scenarios, cancellation/replacement/fallback text controls match</td></tr><tr><td>Long files</td><td>Four synthetic hour requests; Parakeet 2.72% / Qwen 2.37% WER</td></tr><tr><td>Provider transports</td><td>Three local 80-minute fixtures; all 76,800,000 samples each, nine parts each</td></tr><tr><td>MCP defaults / CLI profiles</td><td>Original and −40 dB speech + zero abstention; 17 profile cases</td></tr><tr><td>Help / delivery integrity</td><td>168 bundled links; ZIP CRC, extraction, signatures and extracted CLI inventory</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The first bundle omitted the SRT export linked from help. The check failed before inference, the bundler was fixed and the candidate rebuilt. CI now verifies help links; future bundles also copy nested public receipt assets. <strong>Normal OSpr is visibly restored with eight sessions/265 words and unchanged settings/history.</strong> QA/worker stopped. The unused public WAV was closed while paused at 00:00; no new microphone take or playback occurred.</p><p class="small muted">Known repeated-speech regressions, not natural-meeting accuracy, a latency comparison or a top-three product ranking. Provider replies are local test sentinels, not paid recognition. Physical capture/Capture-AppModel stop, insertion, shortcuts, devices, system audio, clean-Mac/older-OS installation, updater and notarization remain open. Bundled help is the pre-packaging source snapshot; final artifact receipts live in the current report. <a href="../benchmarks/results/streaming-package-gates.json">All exact-build gates</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/streaming-release-package.json">Archive manifest</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/streaming-ci.json">Exact-source Mac CI</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/streaming-portable-app-smoke.json">Relocation and six engines</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/streaming-native-ipc/native-stream-stop.json">Bundled native IPC</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/streaming-mcp.json">Real MCP defaults</a> · <a href="../benchmarks/results/streaming-native-restoration.json">Normal-app restoration</a>.</p></details>'''
